WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.077
What happens to a tRNA after it

00:00:02.124 --> 00:00:03.529
gives away its amino acid?

00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:05.850
It moves over to the E site.

00:00:06.071 --> 00:00:06.942
Now it's empty.

00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:08.277
E is for exit.

00:00:08.904 --> 00:00:10.936
From the E site, the empty tRNA

00:00:11.017 --> 00:00:12.317
leaves the ribosome.

00:00:13.037 --> 00:00:14.198
Like a seat opening up on a

00:00:14.268 --> 00:00:15.057
busy bus.

00:00:15.684 --> 00:00:17.751
The empty tRNA leaves the ribosome from

00:00:17.797 --> 00:00:18.471
the E site.

00:00:19.005 --> 00:00:20.258
Swipe for the recap.
